From 90e6e8f72562e7db815f304be94f83fd8f7eb2a3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Extra <dev@example.com>
Date: Fri, 28 Aug 2026 03:47:20 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add flood-authorization allowlist for public mesh messages

Only peers whose verified fingerprint is on a local allowlist get their
MESSAGE/FILE_TRANSFER packets accepted and relayed by this node. Off by
default; every relaying node needs it enabled with the same fingerprint
set for it to act as a network-wide restriction.
